====================================================

- Release the temporary current-value string on all picture verification exits. Rejected edits now also release the splice buffer and picture state before returning, preventing repeated picture edits from leaking conversion state.
- Preserve picture validation callbacks, autofill behavior, accepted/rejected edit semantics, public interfaces and native ABI. Document the lifetime contract in `docs/datafield-picture-verify-lifetime.md`.
