DataField destination ownership guard (2026-10-24)
==================================================

- Restrict `XtDisownSelection` and display-wide destination clearing to the branch where the DataField actually owns the destination selection. This prevents an unrelated owner from being disowned.
- Preserve destination acquisition/release behavior, callbacks, public interfaces and native ABI. Document the ownership rule in `docs/datafield-destination-selection.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the warning-enabled DataField build and Xvfb DataField action regression.

